sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Workers
  participant I as Interpreter
  participant C as Background compiler
  participant N as Native code
  W->>I: start morsel 1 on bytecode, no wait
  W->>C: compile this pipeline in the background
  W->>I: morsels 2, 3, 4 on bytecode
  C-->>W: native code is ready
  W->>N: morsel 5 onward on native code
  Note over W,N: each morsel checks if native code exists
